Rock Paper Scissors

A simple Rock Paper Scissors game made with JavaScript.

- Player chooses Rock, Paper, or Scissors.
- The computer randomly chooses a move.
- The game plays 5 rounds.
- The result and score are displayed on the page.
- The final winner is displayed after 5 rounds.

Files:
- index.html
- script.js